# NeuroChess Default Rules

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `.agent/PLANS.md` before automated work.
- Keep every mission scoped to one controlled diff.
- Do not modify product code during docs/tooling missions.
- Do not expose forbidden V1 metrics or science claims.
- Use explicit `git add <path>` only.
- Write logs and screenshots outside the repo.
- Stop or quarantine on path violations, staged surprises, write methods in
  read-only tasks, or unreviewed backend side effects.
